{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذَا", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "جَآءَكَ", "translation": "come to you"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "believe"}, {"text": "بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا", "translation": "in Our Verses"}, {"text": "فَقُلْ", "translation": "then say"}, {"text": "سَلَـٰمٌ", "translation": "Peace"}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُمْ ۖ", "translation": "(be) upon you"}, {"text": "كَتَبَ", "translation": "(Has) Prescribed"}, {"text": "رَبُّكُمْ", "translation": "your Lord"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "upon"}, {"text": "نَفْسِهِ", "translation": "Himself"}, {"text": "ٱلرَّحْمَةَ ۖ", "translation": "the Mercy"}, {"text": "أَنَّهُۥ", "translation": "that he"}, {"text": "مَنْ", "translation": "who"}, {"text": "عَمِلَ", "translation": "does"}, {"text": "مِنكُمْ", "translation": "among you"}, {"text": "سُوٓءًۢا", "translation": "evil"}, {"text": "بِجَهَـٰلَةٍۢ", "translation": "in ignorance"}, {"text": "ثُمَّ", "translation": "then"}, {"text": "تَابَ", "translation": "repents"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِهِۦ", "translation": "after it"}, {"text": "وَأَصْلَحَ", "translation": "and reforms"}, {"text": "فَأَنَّهُۥ", "translation": "then, indeed He"}, {"text": "غَفُورٌۭ", "translation": "(is) Oft-Forgiving"}, {"text": "رَّحِيمٌۭ", "translation": "Most Merciful"}], "sahih": "And when those come to you who believe in Our verses, say, \"Peace be upon you. Your Lord has decreed upon Himself mercy: that any of you who does wrong out of ignorance and then repents after that and corrects himself - indeed, He is Forgiving and Merciful.\""}